<h1>GWI Pricing: Complete 2026 Breakdown</h1>

<p>GWI (formerly GlobalWebIndex) is a consumer research and audience intelligence platform trusted by agencies, media owners, and brands globally. It surveys 1.4 million consumers annually across 50+ markets. Unlike most enterprise research tools, GWI offers a publicly disclosed pricing page with genuine self-serve tiers — an unusual transparency in the audience intelligence category.</p>

<h2>Pricing Model</h2>

<p>GWI uses a <strong>tiered subscription model</strong> based on user count, data access depth, and platform features. Pricing is per-user-per-month for the self-serve Plus plan; Teams and Pro tiers involve custom annual contracts. Unlike ad tech DSPs, GWI does not charge a percentage of media spend.</p>

<p>Billing is available monthly or annually. Annual payment saves 15% on the Plus plan (<a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">GWI Pricing Page</a>).</p>

