<h3>Free Plan — $0</h3>

<p>Available without a credit card. Includes (<a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">GWI Pricing Page</a>):</p>
<ul>
<li>10 Agent Spark AI prompts per month</li>
<li>Unlimited GWI Canvas decks (with watermark on exports)</li>
<li>Access to 50,000 profiling points across global markets</li>
<li>Chart generation (limited)</li>
</ul>

<h3>Plus Plan — $150/user/month ($1,500/user/year)</h3>

<p>Self-serve, purchasable directly on gwi.com with all major payment methods. Includes everything in Free, plus (<a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">GWI Pricing Page</a>):</p>
<ul>
<li>Unlimited Agent Spark prompts</li>
<li>Save and export Canvas decks (no watermark)</li>
<li>Previous quarter historical data</li>
<li>Full chart data access</li>
</ul>

<h3>Teams Plan — Custom Pricing</h3>

<p>Contact sales for a quote. Adds (<a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">GWI Pricing Page</a>):</p>
<ul>
<li>View-only access to shared dashboards</li>
<li>Saved audiences in Agent Spark prompts</li>
<li>Multi-user volume discounts</li>
<li>Up to 250,000 profiling points</li>
<li>4 quarters of historical data</li>
</ul>

<h3>Pro Plan — Custom Pricing</h3>

<p>Full platform access. Adds:</p>
<ul>
<li>Crosstabs and custom audiences</li>
<li>15+ years of trended data</li>
<li>LLM-embedded Agent Spark (works within ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot)</li>
<li>Up to 250,000 profiling points</li>
<li>Option to add additional data sets (fees apply)</li>
</ul>

<h3>Enterprise</h3>

<p>Custom solutions with API access, dedicated account manager, expert support, and custom data integration. Contact GWI for pricing.</p>

<h2>Real-World Cost Benchmarks</h2>

<p>Independent research provides some context for Teams and Pro contract sizes:</p>

<ul>
<li>A <a href="https://www.britopian.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Top-10-Audience-Intelligence-Platforms.pdf">Michael Brito industry report</a> estimates full global agency access at <strong>approximately $40,000/year</strong>, noting significant variation based on scope (number of markets, number of users, data set breadth). This figure is described as a "rough ballpark" for full global access.</li>
<li><a href="https://www.guideflow.com/blog/best-audience-intelligence-platforms">Guideflow's 2026 audience intelligence platform comparison</a> notes GWI as "custom" pricing with survey-based global panel data, consistent with the contact-sales model for Teams/Pro.</li>
<li>The same Brito report characterizes GWI as "enterprise-priced (five figures annually)" for full access packages.</li>
</ul>

<p>These third-party estimates should not be taken as quoted prices — actual pricing depends heavily on the number of users, markets accessed, and data modules included.</p>

<h2>Contract Minimums & Terms</h2>

<ul>
<li><strong>Free plan</strong>: No contract, no credit card required</li>
<li><strong>Plus plan</strong>: Monthly or annual. Annual saves 15%. Cancel anytime (per GWI's self-serve model)</li>
<li><strong>Teams/Pro/Enterprise</strong>: Annual contracts typical; contact GWI sales for minimums and terms</li>
<li><strong>Payment currencies</strong>: USD, GBP, EUR accepted (<a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">GWI Pricing Page</a>)</li>
<li><strong>Sales tax</strong>: All prices exclude local sales taxes (<a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">GWI Pricing Page</a>)</li>
<li><strong>Free trial of Pro</strong>: Available — contact GWI sales (<a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">GWI Pricing Page</a>)</li>
</ul>

