<h2>How to Negotiate</h2>

<ol>
<li><strong>Start on Free, upgrade to Plus before your next media plan</strong> — validate the data quality before committing to a custom enterprise contract</li>
<li><strong>For Teams/Pro, benchmark against Statista, YouGov, or Audiense</strong> — these are GWI's closest competitors and can serve as pricing leverage in negotiations</li>
<li><strong>Ask about market-specific packages</strong> — if you only need 2-3 markets, a scoped package will cost significantly less than full global access</li>
<li><strong>Request a Pro trial</strong> — GWI offers this (<a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">per their FAQ</a>) and it's the best way to evaluate whether the crosstabs and trended data justify the step-up from Plus</li>
<li><strong>Volume seat discounts</strong> apply on Teams plans — larger teams should negotiate rates per seat rather than accepting a standard quote</li>
</ol>

