<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

<p><strong>Is GWI pricing public?</strong></p>
<p>Partially. The Free ($0) and Plus ($150/user/month) tiers are fully published on <a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">gwi.com/pricing</a>. Teams, Pro, and Enterprise tiers require a sales conversation.</p>

<p><strong>Can I start GWI for free?</strong></p>
<p>Yes. The Free plan requires no credit card and gives you 10 Agent Spark prompts per month plus unlimited Canvas decks. It's a genuine free tier, not a time-limited trial (<a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">GWI Pricing Page</a>).</p>

<p><strong>What is GWI's minimum annual contract?</strong></p>
<p>GWI does not publicly state a minimum. The Plus plan starts at $1,500/user/year. Custom Teams and Pro plans require direct engagement with sales — the estimated entry for agency-scale access ranges from $15,000–$40,000+/year based on third-party reports.</p>

<p><strong>How does GWI pricing compare to YouGov?</strong></p>
<p>Both are subscription-based consumer research platforms. GWI is more expensive at the enterprise level but includes broader global panel data (50+ markets, 1.4M annual interviews). YouGov offers lower entry points but more limited data depth in some markets. Direct comparison requires quotes from both.</p>

<p><strong>Does GWI charge per seat or per organization?</strong></p>
<p>The Plus plan is priced <strong>per user per month</strong>. Teams and Pro plans include multi-user discounts. Enterprise plans are organization-level with custom seat counts.</p>

<p><strong>Is a free trial available?</strong></p>
<p>Yes — GWI offers a Pro plan free trial upon request via their sales team (<a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">GWI FAQ</a>). The Free plan is itself an ongoing no-cost option, not a trial.</p>

<p><strong>How do I buy GWI Plus?</strong></p>
<p>Self-service — purchase directly on gwi.com using a credit card in USD, GBP, or EUR. No sales call required for Plus (<a href="https://www.gwi.com/pricing">GWI Pricing Page</a>).</p>

<p><strong>What is GWI's G2 rating?</strong></p>
<p>GWI holds a 4.5/5 rating from 183 reviews on G2, making it one of the highest-rated audience intelligence platforms (<a href="https://www.g2.com/products/gwi/reviews">G2 GWI Reviews</a>).</p>

